{
  "displayName": "MultiNet runs",
  "dashboardFilters": [
    {
      "labelKey": "run_id",
      "filterType": "METRIC_LABEL"
    }
  ],
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 10,
        "widget": {
          "title": "About this dashboard",
          "text": {
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "content": "**What this shows.** Coordinators started with `CLOUD_LOGGING=1` write one log entry when they hand an episode to a worker (*started*) and one when that attempt ends (*ended*). There is no per-step progress: an episode in progress shows only as started. Runs launched without the flag do not appear. Setup and fields: `deploy/MONITORING.md`.\n\n**Outcomes.** `solved` / `unsolved`: finished and verified. `infra_killed`: an API, billing or process kill; the unit resumes. `failed`: the attempt failed; the coordinator retries it unless the unit is out of attempts or the failure is final. `stale`: the worker stopped heartbeating; the unit is handed out again. Retries and resumes count as new starts.\n\n**What it does not know.** Charts lag a few minutes (log-based metrics) and count only events after the metrics were created; the event list is closer to live. Delivery is best effort: if Cloud Logging is unreachable, events are dropped and an `events_dropped` entry reports how many once writes resume. The coordinator's `/status` and the finalized results are the source of truth. The run filter applies to the charts and table, not the event list."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 10,
        "width": 16,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Episodes ended in the selected time range",
          "timeSeriesTable": {
            "metricVisualization": "NUMBER",
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/multinet_episodes_ended\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.run_id",
                        "metric.label.model_id",
                        "metric.label.outcome"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "outputFullDuration": true
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 16,
        "yPos": 10,
        "width": 16,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Episodes ended, by outcome",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "300s",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/multinet_episodes_ended\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.outcome"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "episodes per 5 min",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 32,
        "yPos": 10,
        "width": 16,
        "height": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Episodes started, by model (incl. retries and resumes)",
          "xyChart": {
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "300s",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/multinet_episodes_started\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.label.model_id"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "episodes per 5 min",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 26,
        "width": 48,
        "height": 24,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Run events, newest first (all runs)",
          "logsPanel": {
            "filter": "log_id(\"multinet-run-events\")"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
